{"source": "sec_edgar", "source_event_id": "0001575872-26-000719", "published_at": "2026-10-23T16:22:47Z", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-23T16:22:47Z", "headline": "Dr. Reddy's: Review Report of Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm", "body": "To the Shareholders and Board of Directors of Dr. Reddy’s Laboratories Limited Results of Review of Interim Financial Statements We have reviewed the accompanying Unaudited Condensed Consolidated Interim Statement of Financial Position of Dr. Reddy’s Laboratories Limited and subsidiaries (the \"Company\") as of September 30, 2026, the related Unaudited Condensed Consolidated Interim Income Statements and Statements of Comprehensive Income, for the three months and six months periods ended September 30, 2026, and the Unaudited Condensed Consolidated Interim Statement of Changes in Equity and Statement of Cash Flows for the six months periods ended September 30, 2026, and the related notes (collectively referred to as the \"Interim Financial Statements\"). Based on our review, we are not aware of any material modifications that should be made to the accompanying Interim Financial Statements for them to be in conformity with IFRS Accounting Standards as issued by the International Accounting Standards Board (IASB).", "language": "en", "provider_symbols": ["DRREDDY"], "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1135951/000157587226000719/0001575872-26-000719-index.htm", "source_license": "sec_edgar_public_filing"}
{"source": "sec_edgar", "source_event_id": "0001575872-26-000721", "published_at": "2026-10-23T18:02:56Z", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-23T18:02:56Z", "headline": "Dr. Reddy's: report to the SEC (6-K)", "body": "6-K 1 rdy0951_6k.htm FORM 6-K SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION Washington, D.C. 20549 Form 6-K REPORT OF FOREIGN PRIVATE ISSUER PURSUANT TO RULE 13A-16 OR 15D-16 UNDER THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 October 2026 Commission File Number 1-15182 DR. REDDY’S LABORATORIES LIMITED (Translation of registrant’s name into English) 8-2-337, Road No. 3, Banjara Hills Hyderabad, Telangana 500 034, India +91-40-49002900 (Address of principal executive office) Indicate by check mark whether the registrant files or will file annual reports under cover of Form 20-F or Form 40-F. Indicate by check mark if the registrant is submitting the Form 6-K in paper as permitted by Regulation S-T Rule 101(b)(1): ______ Note: Regulation S-T Rule 101(b)(1) only permits the submission in paper of a Form 6-K if submitted solely to provide an attached annual report to security holders.", "language": "en", "provider_symbols": ["DRREDDY"], "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1135951/000157587226000721/0001575872-26-000721-index.htm", "source_license": "sec_edgar_public_filing"}
{"source": "sec_edgar", "source_event_id": "0001575872-26-000724", "published_at": "2026-10-23T18:15:34Z", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-23T18:15:34Z", "headline": "Dr. Reddy's: The updated list of the Company's Senior Management", "body": "Personnel, reflecting the above appointment, is enclosed as Annexure. The disclosure required under Regulation 30 of the SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI Master Circular No. HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/I/3762/2026 dated January 30, 2026, is enclosed as Annexure A. The Board Meeting commenced at 3:00 p.m. IST and concluded at 4:38 p.m. IST. This is for your information and records. Thanking you. Yours faithfully, For Dr. Reddy’s Laboratories Limited K Randhir Singh Company Secretary, Compliance Officer & Head-CSR Encl: as above Details of Mr. Akhil Ravi Brief Profile of Mr. Akhil Ravi Akhil Ravi brings nearly 19 years of experience spanning strategy, commercial leadership, business transformation and general management. Since joining Dr. Reddy's Laboratories in 2018, he has held leadership roles across strategy, commercial operations and business leadership, and currently serves as CEO of Aurigene Pharmaceutical Services Ltd. (APSL), a wholly owned subsidiary of Dr. Reddy’s Laboratories. In this role, he has led APSL's evolution from a start-up-style business into a rapidly scaling CRDMO, driving significant growth, profitability and capability expansion. Since joining Dr.", "language": "en", "provider_symbols": ["DRREDDY"], "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1135951/000157587226000724/0001575872-26-000724-index.htm", "source_license": "sec_edgar_public_filing"}
{"source": "sec_edgar", "source_event_id": "0001575872-26-000725", "published_at": "2026-10-23T18:43:19Z", "first_seen_at": "2026-10-23T18:43:19Z", "headline": "Dr. Reddy's: Unaudited Financial Results for the quarter and half-year ended September 30, 2026", "body": "Pursuant to Regulations 30 and 33 and other applicable provisions of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“SEBI Listing Regulations”) and in furtherance to our letter dated September 22, 2026, we wish to inform you that the Board of Directors of the Company, at their meeting held today, i.e. October 23, 2026, inter alia considered and approved the following: The Board Meeting commenced at 3:00 p.m. IST and concluded at 4:38 p.m. IST. This is for your information and records. Thanking you. Yours faithfully, For Dr. Reddy’s Laboratories Limited K Randhir Singh Company Secretary, Compliance Officer & Head-CSR Encl: as above", "language": "en", "provider_symbols": ["DRREDDY"], "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1135951/000157587226000725/0001575872-26-000725-index.htm", "source_license": "sec_edgar_public_filing"}
